Package: multChernoff
Title: Finite-Sample Tail Bounds of Likelihood Ratio Test under
        Multinomial Sampling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Richard",
           family = "Guo",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ricguo@umich.edu")
Author: Richard Guo [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Richard Guo <ricguo@umich.edu>
Description: Computes finite-sample tail bounds for the likelihood ratio test
    (LRT) under multinomial sampling. The resulting bounds can be used to form
    conservative p-values and critical values when standard chi-squared
    asymptotics may be inaccurate.
